      "id": "g02-insert-clause",
      "text": "在第五条前面加一条保密条款：双方对本合同内容及履行中知悉的商业秘密负有保密义务，期限两年",
      "hostState": "docx:contract",
      "expect": {
        "firstToolAnyOf": [
          "doc_get_document_text",
          "doc_get_clauses",
          "doc_find_text",
          "doc_get_outline",
          "doc_insert_under_heading",
